# Production API URL — Azure Container App (see infra/azure/DEPLOY.md).
#
# The backend runs as an Azure Container App (app.bicep). After deploying it, the
# `appUrl` output is the HTTPS endpoint, e.g.
#   https://ca-kaya-backend.<env-suffix>.spaincentral.azurecontainerapps.io
# Set VITE_API_URL to that value, then rebuild the web client.
#
# Leave empty only when the frontend is served behind a reverse proxy that
# forwards /api, /auth, /me, /admin to the backend (then relative paths are used).
# IMPORTANT: Never use plain HTTP for health data. Always use HTTPS.
VITE_API_URL=https://ca-kaya-backend.REPLACE-WITH-ENV-SUFFIX.spaincentral.azurecontainerapps.io
